    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like i'm just taking up space that someone else could actually use. i used to have a purpose, i had a place in the world, but now i'm just... nothing. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but i know nothing is gonna change. i'm just tired of pretending i'm still part of things.",
