      "content": "but even if i \"stop pretending,\" what is there left? i'm just an empty vessel. any version of me that exists now is just a shadow of what i was. it feels like i'm just lingering in a world that's already moved on without me. like, if i just stopped... would it even matter? would anything actually feel different?",
